#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:0
msgid ""
"Understand the system snap directory, where installed snap packages are "
"mounted, and how its files, revisions, and storage are organised."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:8
msgid "System snap directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:10
msgid ""
"The `/snap` directory is, by default, where the files and folders from "
"installed snap packages appear on your system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:12
msgid "It has the following structure:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:14
msgid ""
"/snap/bin                   - Symlinks to snap applications\n"
"/snap/<snapname>/<revision> - Mount point for snap content\n"
"/snap/<snapname>/current    - Symlink to current revision, if enabled\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:20
msgid "<h2 id=heading--storage-space>Storage space</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:22
msgid ""
"A file manager, or the output from some storage-related commands, will show "
"the files and directories within */snap* taking up space:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:24
msgid ""
"$ du -hs /snap/vlc\n"
"766M    /snap/vlc\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:29
msgid ""
"However, these files and folders are mounted from the heavily compressed "
"data that's stored within the original snap, located in */var/lib/snapd/"
"snaps*. These snaps take far less space on your system than their mount "
"points imply:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:31
msgid ""
"$ mount | grep vlc\n"
"/var/lib/snapd/snaps/vlc_555.snap on /snap/vlc/555 type squashfs "
"(ro,nodev,relatime,x-gdu.hide)\n"
"$ df -h \n"
"Filesystem      Size  Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n"
"/dev/loop12     196M  196M     0 100% /snap/vlc/555\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/system-snap-directory.md:40
msgid ""
"ⓘ  For a detailed overview of what a snap is, see  {ref}`The snap format "
"<reference-development-yaml-schemas-the-snap-format>` documentation."
msgstr ""
